Bundled third-party components
--------------------------------

Gorex distributes the following pre-built binaries as part of its release
packages. Each component retains its own license:

  yt-dlp (yt-dlp.exe / yt-dlp_macos)
    License: The Unlicense (public domain)
    Source:  https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp

  ffmpeg / ffprobe
    License: GNU General Public License Version 3 (bundled builds)
    Source:  https://ffmpeg.org
    Build and source details: licenses/FFmpeg-builds.md
    License text: licenses/GPL-3.0.txt

  Deno
    License: MIT
    Source:  https://github.com/denoland/deno

  TwitchDownloaderCLI
    License: MIT
    Source:  https://github.com/lay295/TwitchDownloader

